# Keyboard shortcuts [Search shortcuts]
=== column 1
## Record
Toggle record (start / stop)             [R]
Record over the selection                [O]
Discard the last take                    [D]
Cancel countdown or recording            [Esc]
## Output
Save frame as PNG                        [F]  (default P)
Export…                                  [Ctrl][E]
## Global (niri)
Record toggle                            [Mod][Shift][R]
Record over                              [Mod][Shift][O]
Discard last take                        [Mod][Shift][D]
Bind these in niri to record while another app has focus. <Copy niri snippet> Paste into ~/.config/niri/config.kdl
## Window
Focus next / previous region             [F6] / [Shift][F6]
Quit                                     [Ctrl][Q]
=== column 2
## Playback
Play / pause                             [Space]
Shuttle reverse / stop / forward         [J] / [K] / [L]
Previous / next frame                    [←] / [→]
Back / forward 1 s                       [Shift][←] / [Shift][→]
Previous / next edit point               [↑] / [↓]
Timeline start / end                     [Home] / [End]
## View
Zoom timeline in / out                   [=] / [−]
Zoom to fit                              [\]
Zoom to selection                        [Z]
Toggle snapping                          [N]
Switch Live / Program                    [Tab]
Toggle bin                               [B]
Keyboard shortcuts                       [?]
Command palette                          [Ctrl][K] or [:]
Settings                                 [Ctrl][,]
=== column 3
## Edit
Select previous / next clip              [,] / [.]
Move selection left / right              [<] / [>]
Split at playhead                        [S]
Trim start to playhead                   [[]
Trim end to playhead                     []]
Nudge trim edge 1 frame (Shift: 10)      [Alt][[] / [Alt][]]
Remove selected clips                    [Del] or [X] or [Backspace]
Autocut selection or all                 [C]
Autocut settings and preview             [Shift][C]
Undo                                     [Ctrl][Z]
Redo                                     [Ctrl][Shift][Z] or [Ctrl][Y]
Select all                               [Ctrl][A]
## Canvas
Nudge layer 1 px (Shift: 10)             [←] / [→] / [↑] / [↓]
-- Keys come from ~/.config/qrec/keys.toml. Change them in Settings › Keyboard. | ["Ctrl", ","] Settings
